    <comment>17-14cm is a 4F FC sz 2 weak layer over a variable K crust.  CTM 12, CTM 14, CTM 12 for three comp test 

side by side at the top edge of wind loaded start zone.  Evidence of avalanche cycle from the past week all along the east-north east aspect of Jimmy Simpson right up to Bow Summit ski hill.  No avalanche activity observed on westerly aspects along the Bow corridor from Banff to Bow Summit.

